{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/150981-killing-an-earthbound","id":150981,"title":"Killing an Earthbound","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-27T20:27:51-07:00","id":150981,"title":"Killing an Earthbound","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">So I'm playing a Tremere Lawyer. I'm totally power-playing &amp; controlling-from-the-shadows type.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">So far the campaign has been to stop a high-gen Ravnos from diablirizing his way up the food chain with the assistance of an Earthbound demon. We killed the guy pretty easily after finding him, very difficultly (Damn gypsies are hard to catch) When he died his ring (the reliquary of the demon) was left behind. I picked it up (I actually picked up the arm of the Ravnos &amp; put it in a bag where it promptly ashed. The demon in the ring then asked me to put it on, ultimate power yada yada yada. I told him I'd draw out a contract, &amp; we would see. When I awoke the next night I was transfigured to look like the Ravnos we had just killed after I convinced the Sheriff to call a Bloodhunt, so it's not exactly the best disguise to have. The demon told me that I would stay this way unless I agreed to be his vessel. I agreed, but I don't want to have a demon slowly alter who &amp; what I am. I think I can convince it for a while to stay in check &amp; not **** me over, but that cannot last long. I need a way to destroy it.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I need to destroy it with little or no repercussions either.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I am Social/Mental with various levels of Contacts Resources Allies &amp; Retainers. Thaumaturgy 3 (Path of Blood) Dominate 1</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2266-aermas","name":"Aermas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2266_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"128"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T00:56:26-07:00","id":151105,"title":"","content":"Any contacts to the sabbat or lasombra antitribu? I'm afraid &quot;killing&quot; an earthbound will not work out that easy, banishing it into the abyss after destroying the ring might work.<br /> <br /> Or maybe summon another demon (no earthbound) who's an enemy of the earthbound and sell the earthbound in a blood-contract to his faction so they can take care of this guy. <br /> <br /> Yes I'm aware that in both cases the earthbound might return eventually really pissed.<br /> <br /> Last thougt is inspired by a D:tF-Ritual. Get your hands on Rego Motum (movement of the mind) and develop a ritualised form that doesn't &quot;move&quot; the target but pins it so it can't move or be moved. Since Earth is travelling pretty fast he will be stuck motionlesa in space in short time and since the universe is still expanding he'll never meet earth again since he is strictly pinned to a fixed location relative to the center of the universe.<br /> <br /> No matter how you get rid of him your biggest problem is that earthbounds are usually old, very old wich means there are legends out there about 'em, what means there are cults, curious people , straight infernalists and scholars of arcane that may know the legends and maybe his true name. So they might be able to summon him from anywhere you put him. So if you don't want to work on a prison-ritual to prevent him from being summoned you should take care of the legends and cults (contacts, allies and retainers might be helpfull in this.<br /> <br /> maybe you can convince the world of occultists that you are his new vessel without being it for real, that way noone searches for him since you are him. And hey, want a cult/herd/retainer backgrounds of an earthbound <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Before I go any further how many dots do you have in megalomania? I have some ideas that might fit at 4 or more <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1235-eadee","name":"Eadee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T06:25:27-07:00","id":151245,"title":"","content":"ok....i run DtF.<br /> First: youre fucked.<br /> Second: youre fucked up<br /> Third: youre so motherfucking fucked up. you dont mess with an earthbound.<br /> <br /> ok...Basically, you have a lovecraftian eldritch horror who by defacto hates vampires. IF an earthbound..a powerful one takes you as a vessel....best scenario, you will explote in a gorefest. i mean literally, you will explote. In the worst case scenario, your soul will be thrown out of your body and your body will be his for a very limitated time.<br /> <br /> Now, how do you get rid of an earthbound? theres some ways.<br /> One: Investigate, investigate ,investigate. try to find out his name.<br /> Second: Find out if he has a cult, if he has a cult youre fucked up.<br /> Third: the most insane eldritch horror looks, the more fucked up your are. i have a rule as a demon player and, the most &quot;fuck you&quot; looks (by fuck you i mean cronembergian or lovecraftian) the more fucked up youre.<br /> Now, if you are lucky, you might countereffect his Lores or use disciplines like Eadee says...if youre not lucky, he will counter them .<br /> Fourth: Destoying an earthbound is impossible in the literal sense. taking down a demon, any demon (i mean to break his spiritual form) would mean pretty much erase an idea from existance (at least thats how i see it), what you need to do is A) break his vessel and make sure he is sent do the Abyssm, B) Break his vessel and make another demon to absorb his form.<br /> Problem with A ) do you want to unleash a freaking clive barker wet dream on the world for a little while? you will need to keep it at bay and trust me, Earthbounds eat vampires for breakfast.<br /> B ) the more Evil the earthbound is, the more evil the demon turns once he absorbed the original one..so, the problem repeats. <br /> Fifth: get yourself an old priest and a young priest, if he is a lesser earthbound that might do....but its a complicated process and takes weeks or months..that if he hasnt ate them and use their flesh as a condom or worst.<br /> Sixth: Find out his name. A demon power come from his name, now be aware that demons use 3 names. his human legal demon (joe doe), his &quot;Angelic Name&quot; (azariphael) and his True Name (y'llgyct). if you find out the true name, he is yours to keep, i warn you, this is very difficult....<br /> <br /> Pros of having an earthbound?: ermm..None. other than being an infernalist and having your own pet eldritch horror<br /> cons: if youre a vampire..lets see....One, they hate vampires, every demon hate the childs of cain with every burning rage.<br /> The camarilla will hunt you down and kill you for having an earthbound...or the earthbound will turn the local camarilla into his bitch.<br /> The sabbat will hunt you down and kill you....Or ..well, same scenario with the camarilla. <br /> <br /> Do Exorcism work? : ermm...its...complicated. since an earthbound needs a living thing to be pushed out from..he can still possess other bodies for short term..or posessing them and making them explote. Then you have the problem of How the fuck will you keep him put while you try to pull the exorsicm. Then, you need someone with true faith.. or true faith potential, and lets be honest, its hard to find one like that, and one willing to help a sneaky vampire bastard.<br /> <br /> Now: repercutions? sorry, youre fucked.<br /> Social and mental: ok...how can you use a social skill or manipulation against something that can literally mindrape you (and yes, they have a lore for that), Thaumaturgy..ok... i always seen demons as being that can pretty much make mage spheres useless so....youre fucked...blood path? ermm....earthbounds have no blood. Dominate 1?, demons cant be controlled by powers, they are the biggest example of free will there is...<br /> <br /> <br /> Now, long story short: youre fucked.<br /> <br /> PS: if the earthbound has a biblical name or a name of a God or big demon...holy shit youre fucked, if the demon's name is Belial or Azatoth or Asmodeus or Baal, or Dagon....Im sorry but you took the Gehenna and made it a walk in the park.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Whats the lesson kiddies? DONT YOU MESS WITH A FUCKING EARTHBOUND UNLESS YOU HAVE THE LOCAL DEMON COURT AS AN ALLY....<br /> Now take your character sheet and add a +1 exp for reading all that.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theo